{"products":[{"id":15435663933597,"title":"King Ice Santa Cruz Classic Dot Necklace","handle":"santa-cruz-x-king-ice-classic-dot-necklace","body_html":"Since 1973, Santa Cruz has been more than a skateboard company. From its roots in California to becoming one of the most influential names in skateboarding, Santa Cruz helped shape a culture built on creativity, individuality, and doing things your own way. Through generations of legendary riders, unforgettable graphics, and countless sessions, the Classic Dot logo has remained a symbol of that legacy.\u003cbr aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003eThe official Santa Cruz x King Ice Classic Dot Necklace celebrates the logo that has traveled from skate decks to streets around the world. Reimagined in jewelry form with premium materials and detailed craftsmanship, it carries over 50 years of skateboarding history in a design that has never needed to change to stay relevant.","published_at":"2026-11-12T06:20:09-08:00","created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:19-08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:45:13-08:00","vendor":"Santa Cruz","product_type":"Apparel Accessory","tags":["badge:King Ice","King Ice","Shopify Collective"],"variants":[{"id":67804101836957,"title":"14K Gold \/ 2.2 in","option1":"14K Gold","option2":"2.2 in","option3":null,"sku":"sku-50707947061423","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":50856176091293,"product_id":15435663933597,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:19-08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:21-08:00","alt":"Santa Cruz King Ice Classic Dot Necklace | color: 14K Gold","width":1100,"height":1100,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0527\/5051\/6381\/files\/santa-cruz-x-king-ice-classic-dot-necklace-14k-gold-2-2-king-ice-1266469312.jpg?v=1794333021","variant_ids":[67804101836957]},"available":true,"price":"120.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":15435663933597,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:19-08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:45:13-08:00"}],"images":[{"id":50856176091293,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:19-08:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:21-08:00","product_id":15435663933597,"variant_ids":[67804101836957],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0527\/5051\/6381\/files\/santa-cruz-x-king-ice-classic-dot-necklace-14k-gold-2-2-king-ice-1266469312.jpg?v=1794333021","width":1100,"height":1100},{"id":50856176124061,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:19-08:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:22-08:00","product_id":15435663933597,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0527\/5051\/6381\/files\/santa-cruz-x-king-ice-classic-dot-necklace-14k-gold-2-2-king-ice-1266469314.jpg?v=1794333022","width":1100,"height":1100},{"id":50856176156829,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:19-08:00","position":3,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:22-08:00","product_id":15435663933597,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0527\/5051\/6381\/files\/santa-cruz-x-king-ice-classic-dot-necklace-14k-gold-2-2-king-ice-1266469313.jpg?v=1794333022","width":1100,"height":1100}],"options":[{"name":"Color","position":1,"values":["14K Gold"]},{"name":"Size","position":2,"values":["2.2 in"]}]},{"id":15435663966365,"title":"King Ice Santa Cruz Roskopp Necklace","handle":"santa-cruz-x-king-ice-roskopp-necklace","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eSome graphics become bigger than the boards they first appeared on. Rob Roskopp's legendary Santa Cruz artwork is part of skateboarding's visual history, born from an era when the graphics beneath your feet were just as much a statement as the way you skated. Created by legendary artist Jim Phillips, the Roskopp graphics helped define the fearless, unmistakable identity of Santa Cruz Skateboards.\u003cbr\u003eThe official Santa Cruz x King Ice Roskopp Necklace pays tribute to that legacy, translating the iconic reaching hand into a sculpted 3D gold centerpiece. Black hand set stones create depth behind the artwork, while brilliant triangular cut stones and an iced border give the original design a new dimension. A stone covered bail completes the piece, bringing two forms of craftsmanship together in celebration of an image that has stood the test of time.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-11-12T06:20:02-08:00","created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:24-08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:45:13-08:00","vendor":"Santa Cruz","product_type":"Apparel Accessory","tags":["badge:King Ice","King Ice","Shopify Collective","TN Only"],"variants":[{"id":67804101869725,"title":"White Gold \/ 2.1 in","option1":"White Gold","option2":"2.1 in","option3":null,"sku":"sku-50707652772015","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":50856176189597,"product_id":15435663966365,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:25-08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:27-08:00","alt":"Santa Cruz King Ice Roskopp Necklace | color: White Gold","width":1100,"height":1100,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0527\/5051\/6381\/files\/santa-cruz-x-king-ice-roskopp-necklace-white-gold-2-1-king-ice-1266268638.jpg?v=1794333027","variant_ids":[67804101869725]},"available":true,"price":"120.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":15435663966365,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:25-08:00","updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:45:13-08:00"}],"images":[{"id":50856176189597,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:25-08:00","position":1,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:27-08:00","product_id":15435663966365,"variant_ids":[67804101869725],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0527\/5051\/6381\/files\/santa-cruz-x-king-ice-roskopp-necklace-white-gold-2-1-king-ice-1266268638.jpg?v=1794333027","width":1100,"height":1100},{"id":50856176222365,"created_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:25-08:00","position":2,"updated_at":"2026-11-10T09:50:26-08:00","product_id":15435663966365,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0527\/5051\/6381\/files\/santa-cruz-x-king-ice-roskopp-necklace-white-gold-2-1-ki